{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"master_title",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🎓 Production AI Engineering\nMaster Roadmap 2025–26\n\nA complete learning system across\n5 phases. Follow left → right.\nEach phase is a separate canvas file.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-200,
			"y":-300,
			"width":400,
			"height":200,
			"color":"#1e293b"
		},
		{
			"id":"p1_card",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔴 PHASE 1\nCore AI Foundations\n& Prerequisites\n\n→ Async I/O, FastAPI, Pydantic\n→ LLM Internals & Tokenization\n→ Model Providers Ecosystem\n→ Prompt Engineering\n→ AI Safety & Ethics\n→ Open Source AI Track\n→ Math Foundations\n\n📁 Phase1_CoreFoundations.canvas",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":400,
			"y":-300,
			"width":320,
			"height":340,
			"color":"#c0392b"
		},
		{
			"id":"hub1_card",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔵 HUB A\nEmbeddings &\nVector Space\n\nBridges Phase 1 ↔ Phase 2\n\n→ Similarity Math\n→ Embedding Models\n→ Dimensionality & Quantization",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":860,
			"y":-180,
			"width":260,
			"height":220,
			"color":"#00b4d8"
		},
		{
			"id":"p2_card",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🟡 PHASE 2\nAdvanced Retrieval\n& RAG Architectures\n\n→ Ingestion & Chunking\n→ Embeddings (deep)\n→ Vector Databases\n→ Search & Reranking\n→ Next-Gen RAG Paradigms\n→ Specialized Retrievers\n→ RAG Frameworks & Eval\n\n📁 Phase2_RAG_Architecture.canvas",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1260,
			"y":-300,
			"width":320,
			"height":360,
			"color":"#e67700"
		},
		{
			"id":"hub2_card",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔵 HUB B\nDistributed Vector\nInfrastructure\n\nBridges Phase 2 ↔ Phase 3\n\n→ Chroma, Pinecone, Qdrant\n→ pgvector, Milvus, Weaviate\n→ Scale & Performance Metrics",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1720,
			"y":-180,
			"width":260,
			"height":240,
			"color":"#00b4d8"
		},
		{
			"id":"p3_card",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🟢 PHASE 3\nConversational Memory\n& Semantic Caching\n\n→ Session & Buffer Memory\n→ Long-Term Semantic Memory\n→ Entity Memory\n→ Semantic Caching Layer\n→ State Persistence\n→ Memory Automation\n\n📁 Phase3_Memory_Caching.canvas",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2120,
			"y":-300,
			"width":320,
			"height":360,
			"color":"#00b894"
		},
		{
			"id":"hub3_card",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔵 HUB C\nState Persistence &\nContext Maintenance\n\nBridges Phase 3 ↔ Phase 4\n\n→ Redis Checkpointers\n→ PostgreSQL Persistence\n→ Event Sourcing",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2580,
			"y":-180,
			"width":260,
			"height":240,
			"color":"#00b4d8"
		},
		{
			"id":"p4_card",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔷 PHASE 4\nAutonomous Agents &\nCognitive State Graphs\n\n→ Agent Reasoning Loops\n→ Tools & Function Calling\n→ LangGraph State Graphs\n→ Human-in-the-Loop\n→ Multi-Agent Orchestration\n→ Agent Memory\n→ Multimodal Agents\n\n📁 Phase4_Agents_StateGraphs.canvas",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2980,
			"y":-320,
			"width":320,
			"height":380,
			"color":"#e84393"
		},
		{
			"id":"hub4_card",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🔵 HUB D\nMultimodal Workflows\n& Coordination\n\nBridges Phase 4 ↔ Phase 5\n\n→ Vision, Audio, Video\n→ DALL-E, Whisper\n→ Multimodal RAG",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3440,
			"y":-180,
			"width":260,
			"height":240,
			"color":"#00b4d8"
		},
		{
			"id":"p5_card",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🟣 PHASE 5\nProduction LLMOps\nTesting & Evaluation\n\n→ LLM Testing & DSPy\n→ Evaluation Metrics (RAGAS)\n→ Observability & Tracing\n→ Guardrails & Security\n→ Production Infrastructure\n→ CI/CD for AI\n→ Cost Optimization\n\n📁 Phase5_LLMOps_Production.canvas",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3840,
			"y":-300,
			"width":320,
			"height":360,
			"color":"#a855f7"
		},
		{
			"id":"order_note",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"📖 HOW TO USE THIS ROADMAP\n\n1. Start Phase 1 top-to-bottom in each group\n2. Teal hub cards = topics shared across phases\n3. 🔷 = key concept with math\n4. ◈ = implementation/practical topic\n5. Each node links to an .md notes file\n6. Cross-group edges (amber) = prerequisite links\n7. Follow the chain: each phase builds on the last",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":400,
			"y":200,
			"width":600,
			"height":260,
			"color":"#1e293b"
		},
		{
			"id":"legend",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🎨 COLOR LEGEND\n\n🔴 Red = Phase 1 (Foundations)\n🟡 Orange = Phase 2 (RAG)\n🟢 Green = Phase 3 (Memory)\n🌸 Pink = Phase 4 (Agents)\n🟣 Purple = Phase 5 (LLMOps)\n🔵 Cyan = Intersection Hubs\n⬛ Dark = Math / Theory nodes\n🟠 Amber edges = Cross-phase links",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1100,
			"y":200,
			"width":400,
			"height":280,
			"color":"#1e293b"
		},
		{
			"id":"prereq_note",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"⚡ PREREQUISITES BEFORE PHASE 1\n\nLanguage: Python 3.10+\nTools: Git, Docker, VS Code/Cursor\nCloud: Any one provider account\nMath: Linear algebra basics\nConcepts: REST APIs, JSON, async/await",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2000,
			"y":200,
			"width":360,
			"height":220,
			"color":"#7c3aed"
		},
		{
			"id":"outcome_note",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"🏆 PHASE OUTCOMES\n\nP1 → Build production FastAPI + LLM apps\nP2 → Deploy full RAG pipelines at scale\nP3 → Design stateful AI memory systems\nP4 → Build autonomous multi-agent systems\nP5 → Ship reliable, monitored, secure AI products",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2800,
			"y":200,
			"width":400,
			"height":220,
			"color":"#065f46"
		}
	],
